##
## Baseline: virtualization guest tools excluded to reduce ISO size.
## (virtualbox-guest-x11, xrdp, open-vm-tools-desktop, qemu-guest-agent,
## spice-vdagent, hyperv-daemons) — display still works at fixed resolution;
## only auto-resize / clipboard sharing are lost. Re-add in a later stage if
## needed for VM integration.
